# Testing & quality

## Tools (lihat `docs/tech-stack.md`)
- **Vitest** — unit: `pricing`, `storage`, `i18n`, config snapshot. Command: `npm test` / `npm run test:watch`.
- **Playwright** — e2e smoke mobile (~390) + desktop; AR unsupported di desktop. Command: `npm run e2e` (setelah `npx playwright install chromium` sekali).
- **ESLint flat** (`eslint.config.js`) + **Prettier** — `npm run lint` / `npm run format`.
- **@lhci/cli** — `npm run lhci` + budgets di `lighthouserc.js` (Perf ≥ 80, A11y ≥ 90).
- **GitHub Actions** — `.github/workflows/ci.yml`: lint → test → build pada push/PR `main`.

## Aturan
- Jangan menambah Jest, Cypress, atau Storybook.
- Tes unit **tanpa** WebGL/DOM berat; mock `localStorage` / pure functions.
- E2E jangan flaky: pakai locator + assert Playwright, bukan `sleep` panjang.
- Setiap task yang mengubah pricing/storage/i18n **wajib** update/ tambah tes Vitest terkait.
- Jelaskan ke Barkah dalam Bahasa Indonesia: beda `npm test` (cepat) vs `npm run e2e` (browser).
- CI merah = jangan bilang task selesai sebelum diperbaiki atau blocker dicatat di `known-issues.md`.
